        <mxCell id="step5" value="6. Native core wrapper returns&lt;br&gt;Unboxes the raw core result · keeps returned allocations alive until post-return" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d7efdf;strokeColor=#387b53;fontColor=#243746;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1">
